  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <p>Longhouse and bungalow guests use the Polynesian Village restaurants. See the <a href="/resorts/polynesian-village-resort/">Polynesian Village full guide</a> for the current list, including 'Ohana, Kona Cafe and Capt. Cook's. Hours change; check Disney's official pages before you book. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></p>
    <p>On the same campus, <strong>Wailulu Bar &amp; Grill</strong> is in the Island Tower lobby. Disney's official page lists a quick-service breakfast from 7:00 a.m. to 11:00 a.m., and table-service lunch and dinner from an all-day menu, with indoor and outdoor seating. Check-in is at the podium in the Island Tower lobby. Official text says parking for dining reservations is at the Polynesian Village hotel, not at Island Tower. <span class="verify">[verify lunch and dinner hours]</span></p>
