  <section id="booking">
    <h2>Booking and value tips</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Check the word "Tower" on the room name.</strong> If it says Tower, you are in Island Tower, not a longhouse studio.</li>
      <li><strong>A bungalow is a different product from a two-bedroom villa at another resort.</strong> Compare occupancy, the lagoon setting and the rate before you assume it is the better deal.</li>
      <li><strong>Disney Vacation Club members book with points; cash rates are full rack prices,</strong> tax included, from the 2026 published ranges above.</li>
    </ul>
